{title: His Steadfast Love Endures Forever}
{subtitle: Psalm 136}
{key: Eb}
{tempo: 100}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Eb] [Eb6] | [Eb6] | [Eb6] | [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Give thanks to the LORD, for he is good
His steadfast love endures forever
Give thanks to the God of gods
His steadfast love endures forever
Give thanks to the Lord of lords
His steadfast love endures forever
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
His steadfast love endures forev[Ab]er
His [Bb]steadfast love endures for[Eb]ever
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
To him who alone [Ab]does great wonders
His steadfast love endures for[Eb]ever
To him who made the heavens [Ab]with understanding
His [Bb]steadfast love endures for[Eb]ever
To him who spread out the earth upon the wa[Ab]ters
His [Bb]steadfast love endures for[Eb]ever
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
To him who made the great lights
His [Ab]steadfast love endures forever
The [Bb]sun to rule over the day
His steadfast [Eb]love endures forever
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
His steadfast love endures for[Ab]ever
His [Bb]steadfast love endures for[Eb]ever
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
Who remembered us when [Ab]we were brought low
His steadfast love endures forev[Eb]er
And broke us free from our foes
His stead[Ab]fast love endures forever
Who gives [Bb]food to all flesh
His stead[Eb]fast love endures forever
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Give thanks to the God of heaven
His stead[Ab]fast love endures forever
His [Bb]steadfast love endures for[Eb]ever
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Outro (instrumental)}
